{"seq":3,"slug":"relevance-signals","title":"相关性信号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/foundations/relevance-signals","wordCount":1558,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"相关性信号\">相关性信号</h1><p>「这篇文档跟查询相关吗」听起来是个二元问题，但重排器在打分时其实在加权融合一堆异质信号：查询里的词有没有在文档里出现、二者讲的是不是同一件事、文档本身够不够权威、用户过去点没点过类似结果。理解这些信号的层次，能解释一个反直觉的现象——纯语义的神经模型有时反而输给「语义+词项」的混合方案。本篇拆解相关性的信号构成，它是读懂后续所有重排模型为什么这样设计的语义地图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-相关性的四层信号\">核心概念：相关性的四层信号</h2><p>把相关性信号按性质分四层。词项信号（lexical）看查询词与文档词的字面重叠，BM25 是其代表。语义信号（semantic）看含义是否接近，哪怕用词完全不同，神经编码器是其代表。结构信号（structural）看文档自身属性：标题命中比正文命中更重要、新文档比旧文档更可信、来源权威度。行为信号（behavioral）看群体反馈：历史点击率、停留时长、转化——这些不在文档里，而在日志里。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Q[查询 + 文档] --&gt; L[词项信号&lt;br/&gt;BM25 词频/逆文档频率]&#10;  Q --&gt; S[语义信号&lt;br/&gt;神经编码器 含义匹配]&#10;  Q --&gt; ST[结构信号&lt;br/&gt;标题/时效/权威度]&#10;  Q --&gt; B[行为信号&lt;br/&gt;点击/停留/转化]&#10;  L --&gt; F[融合打分]&#10;  S --&gt; F&#10;  ST --&gt; F&#10;  B --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; R[相关性分数]\">flowchart TD\n  Q[查询 + 文档] --&gt; L[词项信号&lt;br/&gt;BM25 词频/逆文档频率]\n  Q --&gt; S[语义信号&lt;br/&gt;神经编码器 含义匹配]\n  Q --&gt; ST[结构信号&lt;br/&gt;标题/时效/权威度]\n  Q --&gt; B[行为信号&lt;br/&gt;点击/停留/转化]\n  L --&gt; F[融合打分]\n  S --&gt; F\n  ST --&gt; F\n  B --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; R[相关性分数]</pre><p>不同重排器覆盖不同层。纯交叉编码器主攻词项+语义（拼接后注意力既看字面也看含义）；排序学习（learning-to-rank）模型把四层都当特征喂进去；LLM 重排器靠世界知识隐式覆盖语义与部分结构信号。没有哪个模型天然覆盖全部，这正是混合方案存在的理由。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号层</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n<th>捕捉什么</th>\n<th>弱点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>词项</td>\n<td>BM25 / TF-IDF</td>\n<td>精确词匹配、稀有词、专名</td>\n<td>同义/改写完全失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义</td>\n<td>双/交叉编码器</td>\n<td>含义接近、改写、跨语言</td>\n<td>专名/数字/否定易糊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构</td>\n<td>特征工程</td>\n<td>标题命中、时效、权威</td>\n<td>需领域规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为</td>\n<td>点击模型</td>\n<td>群体真实偏好</td>\n<td>冷启动、位置偏差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"词项-vs-语义-为什么-bm25-杀不死\">词项 vs 语义：为什么 BM25 杀不死</h2><p>一个流行的误解是「有了神经语义模型，BM25 这种老古董该淘汰了」。现实相反：到 2026 年，混合检索（BM25 + 向量）仍是召回阶段的强基线，原因在于两类信号的失效模式正好互补。BM25 在精确词匹配上无可替代——产品型号「ABC-9000」、人名、API 函数名、罕见专业术语，这些低频 token 的精确命中是语义模型的盲区，因为编码器会把它们糊进相近的向量。反过来，BM25 对同义改写、跨语言、概念泛化完全无能，而这正是语义模型的主场。</p>\n<p>BM25 的打分形式也值得记住，后面讲特征会用到：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>BM25</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>IDF</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mtext>avgdl</mtext></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{BM25}(q,d)=\\sum_{t\\in q} \\text{IDF}(t)\\cdot \\frac{f(t,d)\\cdot(k_1+1)}{f(t,d)+k_1\\cdot(1-b+b\\cdot \\frac{|d|}{\\text{avgdl}})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BM25</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4361em;vertical-align:-1.3861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IDF</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8081em;vertical-align:-1.3811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.01em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">avgdl</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.24em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.01em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.687em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.01em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(t,d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是词 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 在文档 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 的频次，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>IDF</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{IDF}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IDF</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是逆文档频率（罕见词权重高），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是调节词频饱和与长度归一的超参。它不需要训练、不需要 GPU、可解释。重排器把它当作一路输入信号融合进来，而不是取代它。混合两路信号的融合工程见兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../ai-search-retrieval/neural-retrieval/sparse-dense-hybrid\">稀疏-稠密混合</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"行为信号与排序学习\">行为信号与排序学习</h2><p>词项和语义信号只看「查询-文档」本身，但工业搜索的精排往往最依赖第四层——行为信号。一篇被千万人点过、停留很久的文档，比一篇字面更匹配却没人看的文档更可能是好答案。问题是行为信号有偏：排在第一位的结果天然被点得多（位置偏差），这要用点击模型去偏才能用。</p>\n<p>把多层信号融合成最终排序，经典做法是排序学习（learning-to-rank, LTR）：把每个「查询-文档」对表示成一个特征向量——BM25 分数、语义相似度、标题命中、时效、点击率……——再训一个模型输出排序分。神经重排器可以看作 LTR 的一个特例，只不过它把「词项+语义」两路特征端到端地学进了一个 Transformer 里。LTR 的训练范式与损失是本 hub 第三章的核心，见 <a href=\"../training/training-rerankers\">重排器训练</a> 与 <a href=\"../training/listwise-objectives\">列表级目标</a>；搜索系统视角的 LTR 见兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../ai-search-retrieval/ranking-models/learning-to-rank\">排序学习</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"信号的失效与陷阱\">信号的失效与陷阱</h2><p>每层信号都有系统性盲区，知道盲区才能选对模型。语义模型对否定特别脆弱——「不含麸质的食谱」和「含麸质的食谱」向量极近，因为编码器对「不」字不敏感；对数字与单位也常出错（「8GB 内存」vs「8TB 内存」）。词项信号对长尾改写无能。行为信号有冷启动（新文档没日志）和流行度偏差（热门未必相关）。结构信号需要领域规则、迁移性差。</p>\n<p>实践含义是：不要指望单一信号通吃。一个稳健的重排器，要么在训练时用 <a href=\"../training/hard-negatives-distillation\">难负样本</a> 把否定、近义专名这类困难情形喂进去逼它学会区分，要么在架构上多路融合让信号互补。下一章的三类重排器，本质就是在「用什么信号、怎么融合」上做了不同选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>相关性是四层异质信号的加权融合：词项（字面）、语义（含义）、结构（文档属性）、行为（群体反馈）。</li>\n<li>BM25 代表的词项信号在专名、型号、罕见词上不可替代，与语义信号失效模式互补，故混合检索长期不死。</li>\n<li>排序学习把多层信号当特征统一打分，神经重排器是「词项+语义」端到端学习的特例。</li>\n<li>每层信号都有系统盲区：语义模型怕否定与数字、行为信号有位置偏差与冷启动——靠难负样本或多路融合补救。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"bi-vs-cross-encoder\">双编码器与交叉编码器</a> —— 不同架构覆盖不同信号层。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../training/training-rerankers\">重排器训练</a> —— 把信号学进模型的训练范式。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../training/hard-negatives-distillation\">难负样本与蒸馏</a> —— 用困难样本逼模型学会语义盲区。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../ai-search-retrieval/neural-retrieval/sparse-dense-hybrid\">稀疏-稠密混合</a> —— 词项与语义两路的融合工程。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../ai-search-retrieval/ranking-models/learning-to-rank\">排序学习</a> —— 多信号特征的 LTR 框架。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"相关性信号","id":"相关性信号"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：相关性的四层信号","id":"核心概念-相关性的四层信号"},{"level":2,"text":"词项 vs 语义：为什么 BM25 杀不死","id":"词项-vs-语义-为什么-bm25-杀不死"},{"level":2,"text":"行为信号与排序学习","id":"行为信号与排序学习"},{"level":2,"text":"信号的失效与陷阱","id":"信号的失效与陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"双编码器与交叉编码器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/foundations/bi-vs-cross-encoder"},"next":{"title":"交叉编码器重排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/rerankers/cross-encoder-rerankers"}}